# Tendril of the Mycotyrant: the target is a noncreature land you control. With all seven mana available, Bot1 cannot target the Tendril itself (a
# creature, not a land), Bot2's Forest (not Bot1's), or - after animating its Forest - that Forest again (now a creature). Only Bot1's own Forest
# is offered the first time.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Forest
Tendril of the Mycotyrant
Black Lotus
Forest x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Forest x30

